DESCRIPTION:Ryan Erwin is a ray of absolute sunshine! Originally from Brigh
 am City Utah he now makes Brooklyn New York his home. He travels the countr
 y performing for colleges\, corporate events\, cruises and comedy clubs. He
  has been featured on DryBar Comedy with his first special (Vertical Claps)
  debuting in 2019 and his second special (The Shape of Wear) was released i
 n April 2024.\n\nHe got his start at Wiseguys Comedy Club in Utah and moved
  to Raleigh North Carolina where he regularly performed at Goodnights Comed
 y Club and the Raleigh Improv. His debut album (Thank You\, Thank You) is c
 urrently streaming on SiriusXM. His second album (Full-Time Quitter) will b
 e released in October 2024.\n\nHe currently lives in New York City where he
  is a regular at several comedy clubs. He was recently recognized as the Wi
 nner of the Empire State Comedy Festival. He has been a selected performer 
 for over a dozen other comedy festivals and competitions most notably being
  awarded 2nd Runner Up in North Carolina’s Funniest 2022 and Best of Fest
  at Big Pine Comedy Festival 2021 & Burbank Comedy Festival 2021.\n\nWhethe
 r he is talking about being raised Mormon by two deaf parents\, his time sp
 ent as a middle school teacher or his fabulous self\; audiences are sure to
  love him\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/ryan-erwin
 -23501/
